Technology Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This immersive VR simulation delivers realistic, hands-on training in essential surgical technology skills and operating room procedures. Learners can practice sterile techniques, surgical instrument identification and handling, operating room preparation, and workflow coordination in a safe, interactive environment. Designed to align with industry and educational standards, the app helps students strengthen technical accuracy, safety compliance, and confidence before entering real-world clinical settings. Surgical Technology provides a risk-free space for developing critical perioperative skills and improving procedural knowledge through experiential learning. \n\nAccess to this application is restricted to students enrolled in the certification program for their hands-on training.", "short_description": "Surgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on practice in surgical procedures, instrument handling, sterile techniques, and operating room protocols within a realistic virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported